---
// Recursive bisection on the 12 simulated stocks (250 days, Ward order). Python numbers:
// level 1: left half (R1 R3 R2 R4 S2 S1) variance 2.1536, right half (S3 S4 B2 B3 B1 B4) 1.0425 -> alpha_left 0.326
// level 2: [R1 R3 R2 | R4 S2 S1] alpha_left 0.505 ; [S3 S4 B2 | B3 B1 B4] alpha_left 0.424
// final weights in tree order: R1 7.05, R3 4.58, R2 4.85, R4 9.20, S2 3.40, S1 3.54, S3 5.75, S4 4.66, B2 18.20, B3 17.63, B1 10.64, B4 10.51 (%)
const order = ['R1','R3','R2','R4','S2','S1','S3','S4','B2','B3','B1','B4'];
const w = [7.05, 4.58, 4.85, 9.20, 3.40, 3.54, 5.75, 4.66, 18.20, 17.63, 10.64, 10.51];
const colOf = (n: string) => (n[0] === 'B' ? 'var(--act-3)' : n[0] === 'S' ? 'var(--act-1)' : 'var(--act-2)');
const W = 900, H = 390, X0 = 28, STEP = 70.5, CW = 62;
const cx = (i: number) => X0 + i * STEP;
const vi = (x: number) => x.toFixed(1).replace('.', ',');
---
<figure class="p10bs">
  <div class="p10bs-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Twelve stocks in tree order with their final weights. The first split cuts the list into two halves of six: the left half has a variance of 2.15 and gets 32.6 percent of the weight, the right half has a variance of 1.04 and gets 67.4 percent. The second split divides each half into thirds: 50.5 and 49.5 percent on the left, 42.4 and 57.6 percent on the right. The cut falls inside the steel group. Final weights range from 3.4 percent for S2 to 18.2 percent for B2.">
    <text x="20" y="28" class="p10bs-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Recursive bisection: the calmer half gets more</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Chia đôi đệ quy: nửa êm hơn được nhiều hơn</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x={cx(0)} y="50" width={cx(5) + CW - cx(0)} height="40" rx="6" class="p10bs-span" />
    <text x={cx(0) + 8} y="68" class="p10bs-sp">
      <tspan data-lang-en>left half: variance 2.15</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nửa trái: phương sai 2,15</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cx(0) + 8} y="84" class="p10bs-al">
      <tspan data-lang-en>gets 32.6%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>được 32,6%</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x={cx(6)} y="50" width={cx(11) + CW - cx(6)} height="40" rx="6" class="p10bs-span is-big" />
    <text x={cx(6) + 8} y="68" class="p10bs-sp">
      <tspan data-lang-en>right half: variance 1.04</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nửa phải: phương sai 1,04</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cx(6) + 8} y="84" class="p10bs-al">
      <tspan data-lang-en>gets 67.4%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>được 67,4%</tspan>
    </text>
    {[[0, 2], [3, 5], [6, 8], [9, 11]].map(([a, b]) => (
      <rect x={cx(a)} y="104" width={cx(b) + CW - cx(a)} height="26" rx="5" class="p10bs-span2" />
    ))}
    {[[0, '50.5%', '50,5%'], [3, '49.5%', '49,5%'], [6, '42.4%', '42,4%'], [9, '57.6%', '57,6%']].map(([a, en, vv]) => (
      <text x={cx(a as number) + (3 * STEP - 8) / 2} y="122" text-anchor="middle" class="p10bs-sp2">
        <tspan data-lang-en>{en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{vv}</tspan>
      </text>
    ))}
    {order.map((n, i) => (
      <g>
        <rect x={cx(i)} y="150" width={CW} height="34" rx="17" class="p10bs-chip" style={`stroke:${colOf(n)}`} />
        <text x={cx(i) + CW / 2} y="172" text-anchor="middle" class="p10bs-cn" style={`fill:${colOf(n)}`}>{n}</text>
        <rect x={cx(i) + 10} y={300 - w[i] * 4.6} width={CW - 20} height={w[i] * 4.6} rx="2" class="p10bs-bar" style={`fill:${colOf(n)}`} />
        <text x={cx(i) + CW / 2} y={294 - w[i] * 4.6} text-anchor="middle" class="p10bs-w">
          <tspan data-lang-en>{w[i].toFixed(1)}%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{vi(w[i])}%</tspan>
        </text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <line x1={cx(0)} y1="300" x2={cx(11) + CW} y2="300" class="p10bs-base" />
    <text x="20" y="330" class="p10bs-s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Say 12 simulated stocks, 250 days. The cut at the middle of the list falls inside the steel group (S2, S1 left, S3, S4 right).</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Giả sử 12 cổ phiếu mô phỏng, 250 ngày. Nhát cắt ở giữa danh sách rơi vào trong nhóm thép (S2, S1 bên trái, S3, S4 bên phải).</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="20" y="352" class="p10bs-s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Totals by sector: banks 57.0%, retail 25.7%, steel 17.3%. Banks are the calmest group, so they get the most.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Tổng theo ngành: ngân hàng 57,0%, bán lẻ 25,7%, thép 17,3%. Ngân hàng êm nhất nên được nhiều nhất.</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="20" y="374" class="p10bs-s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Variance of a half = variance of its inverse-variance portfolio, in %² per day². Dashed boxes: the second split.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Phương sai của một nửa = phương sai của danh mục nghịch đảo phương sai trong nửa đó, đơn vị %² mỗi ngày². Khung đứt: lần chia thứ hai.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Weights are the product of the split factors along the path from the top to each stock.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Tỷ trọng là tích các hệ số chia dọc đường đi từ đỉnh xuống từng cổ phiếu.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .p10bs { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .p10bs-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .p10bs svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 820px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .p10bs text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .p10bs .p10bs-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p10bs .p10bs-sp { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p10bs .p10bs-al { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p10bs .p10bs-sp2 { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p10bs .p10bs-cn { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }
  .p10bs .p10bs-w { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .p10bs .p10bs-s { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p10bs-span { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .p10bs-span.is-big { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); }
  .p10bs-span2 { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.1; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .p10bs-chip { fill: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .p10bs-bar { opacity: 0.85; }
  .p10bs-base { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .p10bs figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
